# Naming Conventions

**C#:** Classes/types PascalCase; variables/parameters camelCase; private fields _camelCase.

**Scenes:** PascalCase descriptive names (MainMenu, CellStage, CreatureStage, TribalStage, CivStage, SpaceStage, CreatureEditor).

**Prefabs:** PascalCase; match purpose (e.g. CreaturePart prefabs by part type).

**Assets (Blender/Unity):** _VIS (visible), _COL (collider), _LOD0/_LOD1/_LOD2 for LOD meshes.

**Events:** Descriptive past tense or noun (StageTransitionEvent, CreatureEvolved, DNAPointsChanged).
